      "quote": "The primary outcomes in this study were rates of PTB and stillbirth. Secondary outcomes included mean birthweight (continuous) and rates of low birthweight (LBW), spontaneous PTB, medically indicated PTB, and neonatal, perinatal, or maternal mortality.",
